{%- capture mkbody -%}
<style>
/* K · Cormorant Garamond with Jost. Announcement bar, one-row header. Menus: capital text columns with a photograph flush right. Two buttons under the intro. */
:root{--display:"Cormorant Garamond",Georgia,serif;--sans:"Jost",system-ui,sans-serif}
.logo{font-size:32px;font-weight:600}
.nav{margin-left:clamp(36px,4vw,64px);gap:clamp(18px,2vw,30px)}
.hero-copy h1{font:600 clamp(38px,3.8vw,60px)/1.02 var(--display)}
.hide-d{display:none}
@media (max-width:1080px){.hide-d{display:inline-flex}}
.sp + .ws{padding-top:0}
.sp:has(+ .ws){padding-bottom:clamp(40px,4vw,56px)}
.bh + .sp-size{padding-top:0}
.sp-size + .pv-k{padding-top:0}
.sp-size:has(+ .pv-k){padding-bottom:clamp(40px,4vw,56px)}
.pv-k + .rv{padding-top:clamp(40px,4vw,56px)}
.pv-k + .bd2{padding-top:0}
.bd2 + .rv{padding-top:0}
.rv.r1 .cards{align-items:stretch}
.rv.r1 .cd{border-top:0;padding-top:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;height:100%}
.rv.r1 .cd .rq{flex:1}
/* one rhythm: every section below the hero sits the same distance apart */
:root{--sec:clamp(56px,6vw,88px)}
main > section:not(.hero):not(.next){padding-top:0!important;padding-bottom:0!important;margin-top:var(--sec)!important;margin-bottom:0!important}
main > section.next{margin-top:var(--sec)}
</style>

{%- capture mk_uk -%}{% render 'mk', k: 'uk' %}{%- endcapture -%}<div class="dw"><header class="dw-hero"><div class="dw-w"><nav class="dz-crumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Home</a><span>/</span><a href="/pages/help">Help</a><span>/</span><span aria-current="page">Returns &amp; refunds</span></nav><h1>Returns &amp; refunds</h1><p>If something isn&rsquo;t quite right, you have 14 days to change your mind.</p></div></header><section class="dw-keys"><div class="dw-w"><div><b>14 days to change your mind</b><span>From the day after delivery</span></div><div><b>Unworn, with tags</b><span>Return postage paid by you</span></div><div><b>Faulty items</b><span>Refunded or replaced</span></div></div></section><div class="dw-body dw-w"><aside class="dw-side"><div class="dw-on"><span>On this page</span><a href="#how">How to return something</a><a href="#refunds">Your refund</a><a href="#condition">Condition of returns</a><a href="#exchanges">Exchanges</a><a href="#faulty">Faulty, damaged or incorrect</a><a href="#faqs">Returns FAQs</a></div></aside><div class="dw-main"><section id="how"><h2>How to return something</h2><p class="dw-lead">You can return anything unworn, with its tags, for a refund.</p><div class="dw-tw"><table class="dw-tb dw-steps"><thead><tr><th scope="col">Step</th><th scope="col">When</th><th scope="col">What happens</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row" data-l="Step">Tell us</th><td data-l="When"><span>Within 14 days of delivery</span></td><td data-l="What happens"><span>Email hello@axelandhound.com with your order number and the items you&rsquo;re returning.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" data-l="Step">Send it back</th><td data-l="When"><span>Within 14 more days</span></td><td data-l="What happens"><span>Pack it securely and post it to us. You arrange and pay for return postage. Please keep your proof of postage.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope="row" data-l="Step">Refunded</th><td data-l="When"><span>Within 14 days of it reaching us</span></td><td data-l="What happens"><span>To your original payment method.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>{%- if mk_uk == "true" -%}<p><b>Return address:</b> Poorly Pet Ltd, 4 Lomas Road, Sandbach, Cheshire, CW11 3EE, United Kingdom.</p>{%- else -%}<p><b>Return address:</b> please email us before posting your parcel and we&rsquo;ll send you the address to use.</p>{%- endif -%}<div class="dw-btns"><a class="dw-btn" href="/pages/contact">Contact us</a></div></section><section id="refunds"><h2>Your refund</h2><p>We refund you within 14 days of receiving your return, or of you showing us proof you&rsquo;ve sent it, whichever is sooner. Refunds go to your original payment method.{%- if mk_uk == "true" %} If you cancel your whole order within 14 days of delivery, we also refund the standard delivery charge you paid.{%- endif -%}</p></section><section id="condition"><h2>Condition of returns</h2><p>You can handle and try things on as you would in a shop. If an item has been worn on a walk, washed, or had its tags removed, we may reduce your refund to reflect the loss in its value. Unless they&rsquo;re faulty, we can&rsquo;t take back personalised items, or treats and chews once opened.</p></section><section id="exchanges"><h2>Exchanges</h2><p>We don&rsquo;t offer exchanges. If you need a different size or colour, return the item for a refund and place a new order.</p></section><section id="faulty"><h2>Faulty, damaged or incorrect</h2><p>If an item arrives damaged, develops a fault or isn&rsquo;t what you ordered, email hello@axelandhound.com with your order number and a photo. We&rsquo;ll arrange a replacement or a refund, and if we need the item back we&rsquo;ll cover the reasonable cost of returning it.{%- if mk_uk == "true" %} Under the Consumer Rights Act 2015 you can reject a faulty item for a full refund within 30 days of delivery. After that, you may be entitled to a repair, replacement or refund.{%- endif -%} Your statutory rights are not affected.</p></section><section id="faqs"><h2>Returns FAQs</h2><div class="dw-faq"><details><summary>How long does a refund take?</summary><p>We refund you within 14 days of your return reaching us. Your bank may take a few more days to show it.</p></details><details><summary>Who pays for return postage?</summary><p>You do, when you change your mind. If the item is faulty, damaged or incorrect, we cover the reasonable cost of sending it back.</p></details><details><summary>Can I return a gift?</summary><p>Yes. We&rsquo;ll refund the person who bought it, to their original payment method.</p></details></div></section><section class="dw-help"><h2>Still need help?</h2><p>Our team is here Monday to Friday, 9am to 5pm, and replies to every message within one working day.</p><a class="dw-btn" href="/pages/contact">Contact us</a></section></div></div></div>
{%- endcapture -%}{%- render 'mk-out', html: mkbody -%}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Returns",
  "tag": "div",
  "class": "ah-sec"
}
{% endschema %}
